<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $48-3/8 (FIM 220.49).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $48-3/8 (FIM 220.49).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR</p>
<p>closed up $1-3/8 at $48-3/8 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 220.49 markka. In</p>
<p>Helsinki on Wednesday Nokia A closed up 2.60 markka at 215.60.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed down $0-1/4</p>
<p>at 30-7/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 70.36 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki, Valmet closed 0.50 markka lower at 71.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded in New York on</p>
<p>Wednesday. In Helsinki, Rauma closed up 1.40 markka at 83.40.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
